/S /H4
/P 109 0 R
/T (The development of autonomous systems therefore presents DISEC with a central policy dilemma: How can states benefit from technological innovation while ensuring that human control, accountability, and international law remain meaningful?)
/E (The development of autonomous systems therefore presents DISEC with a central policy dilemma: How can states benefit from technological innovation while ensuring that human control, accountability, and international law remain meaningful?)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [11]
