/T (Drone warfare also continues to develop rapidly. The increasing availability of relatively inexpensive unmanned systems has lowered the technological barriers to obtaining aerial capabilities. The widespread proliferation of commercial off-the-shelf \(COTS\) components, first-person-view \(FPV\) loitering munitions, and low-cost uncrewed aerial vehicles \(UAVs\) has fundamentally reshaped modern conflict. )
/E (Drone warfare also continues to develop rapidly. The increasing availability of relatively inexpensive unmanned systems has lowered the technological barriers to obtaining aerial capabilities. The widespread proliferation of commercial off-the-shelf \(COTS\) components, first-person-view \(FPV\) loitering munitions, and low-cost uncrewed aerial vehicles \(UAVs\) has fundamentally reshaped modern conflict. )
