423 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 118 0 R
/T (The expiration of New START in February 2026 removed the last remaining bilateral treaty imposing binding limits on the strategic nuclear arsenals of the United States and Russia. This has increased concerns regarding strategic predictability and transparency.)
